  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ain o Salish Kendra (2017-2021) - Ain o Salish Kendra (2017-2022)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ain o Salish Kendra (2017-2021)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to the next phase of ASK&apos;s programme addressing the human rights situation in Bangladesh during 2017-2021.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sidas st&#xf6;d best&#xe5;r av k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till n&#xe4;stkommande fas, 2017-2021, av Ain o Salish Kendra&apos;s initiativ med fokus p&#xe5; situationen i Bangladesh avseende m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 1: Local human rights actors are actively undertaking and facilitating initiatives on human rights and gender issues.
Outcome 2: Disempowered people have increased access to justice through legal aid
Outcome 3: Working Children increasigly enjoy fundamental human rights
Outcome 4: State institutions are increasingly responsive to respecting human rights under their jurisdiction</narrative>
  </description>
